Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: use valid J514s PIODMA alias

Follow Asahi m1n1 a997f4eb552beb517fa44420f8b50457fb5cd7c7.
DT labels may contain underscores, but /aliases property names may not.
Only the development J514s alias changes; the node label and disabled state
remain unchanged. Requires loader alias compatibility before future use.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6030-display.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6030-display.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6030-display.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6030-display.dtsi
@@ -9,7 +9,7 @@
 	aliases {
 		dcp = &dcp;
 		disp0 = &display;
-		disp0_piodma = &disp0_piodma;
+		disp0-piodma = &disp0_piodma;
 	};
 
 	/* Placeholder rates are replaced from the current boot ADT by m1n1.
